# SSH client configuration
# Installed to ~/.ssh/config by `make copy-ssh`.
#
# Ghostty sets TERM=xterm-ghostty, which is not available on most
# remote servers. Falling back to xterm-256color ensures ncurses-based
# tools (htop, vim, etc.) work over SSH without terminfo errors.
# Requires OpenSSH ≥8.7 (ships with modern macOS).

Host *
  SetEnv TERM=xterm-256color
